<title>UK: De Beers says Russia talks &quot;constructive&quot;.</title>
<headline>De Beers says Russia talks &quot;constructive&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond giant De Beers Consolidated Mines Ltd said on Tuesday it was in &quot;constructive&quot; talks with Russia's diamond authorities to try to find a new contract on diamond sales.</p>
</text>
